		<summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;Eric Lengyel: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div&gt;[[File:Paneleditor.png|right|frame|'''Figure 1.''' The Panel Editor window.]]&lt;br /&gt;
