* &amp;lt;code&amp;gt;[http://c4engine.com/docs/InterfaceMgr/StrokeWidget.html StrokeWidget]&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; class&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
[[Category:Interface]]&lt;/div&gt;</summary>
		<author><name>Eric Lengyel</name></author>
	</entry>
